    "Open-gap is an additive common offset per compared author/beam layer; that ablation cannot change ranking in these paths.",
    "Author and beam have different budget units; work comparisons are descriptive, not equal-work claims.",
    "Three seeds and seven fixture tasks do not establish broad generalization.",
    "Source and fixture hashes are independently reproduced; SpikeForge hashes and clean commit are the measurement's recorded dependency provenance."
